OL,3,GNEWSACouncil proposes 20mph speed
OL,4,Alimits near schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said, if approved, the
OL,7,Fmandatory limits would be in operation
OL,8,Fat all times and enforced by the
OL,9,Fpolice.
